  "description": "Introducing the “Romantic Rose Garden” wedding clipart collection, where the timeless allure of soft summer blooms meets the passion of red roses in a symphony of elegance. Immerse yourself in the ethereal beauty of watercolor roses, delicately crafted to capture the essence of romance. Each element, from the enchanting summer frame adorned with delicate pink roses to the exquisite red flowers clipart, exudes a sense of timeless charm and sophistication. Elevate your designs with this captivating array of wedding flowers, perfect for invitations, stationery, and other romantic projects. Let the “Romantic Rose Garden” inspire your creations and infuse them with the enchanting beauty of blooming love.\n♡ What is included:\n8 bouquets, size approx.: 3192 x 3038 px | 10″x10″, and smaller\n3 frames, size approx.: 3986 x 4484 px | 13″x15″, and smaller\nAll files are high resolution (300dpi) and have a transparent background (.png)",
